## zunoworks/gateguard — via ECC

`hooks/gateguard.py` is OSForge's Python re-implementation of the fact-forcing gate that ECC
ships as `scripts/hooks/gateguard-fact-force.js`, which itself credits
https://github.com/zunoworks/gateguard (package `gateguard-ai`). No code was copied; the gate
design (demand importers / API surface / schema / verbatim instruction before Edit, Write or a
destructive command) is theirs.

## mattpocock/skills — MIT

`docs/SKILL-STANDARD.md` and `docs/SKILL.template.md` adopt the activation/predictability model
from mattpocock/skills (`inspired_by` in the files). The "smart zone / dumb zone" vocabulary in
`claude-code/SKILLS.md` is from mattpocock/dictionary-of-ai-coding.

